## Import

Fastly Dictionary items can be imported using the service ID and dictionary ID
separated by a forward slash:

```shell
terraform import fastly_service_dictionary_items.example <service_id>/<dictionary_id>
```

Import adopts all items currently present in the Dictionary into this
resource's Terraform state. Before applying configuration after an import,
ensure that the `items` map contains every imported key you want Terraform to
continue managing. Removing an imported key from `items` tells Terraform to
delete that key.
